      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING URBAN (1) filled a minor placing last start at Capalaba behind Big Al's (19.69) in a OPEN. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Likely to feature again. MY BOY BINGO (4) placed last time (31.58) at Darwin in a OPEN, finishing second and beaten 2.5 lengths. Has already won three times from this draw. Looks well placed here and among the chances. APACHE TIGER (8) is a well performed dog and winner of 27 races who was in the minor money last time out at Q Lakeside (30.48). Form here at the trip excellent including five wins. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be in the finish again. ZIPPING MEHARY (2) racing over this course and distance brings the best out in him.",
